id: pm-axotea
title: Prose graph census misses valid item identifiers with multiple hyphens
description: "The public prose_edge_gap SDK measurement reports one missing pair for a canonical pm-target reference but zero for a canonical pm-2evidence-dist reference under the same two-item context. The census token pattern accepts only one hyphen, undercounting missing links for custom identifiers accepted by the CLI."
